    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## \ud83e\udd16 GrowthAgent \u2014 Master Orchestrator (GEOS Edition)\n\n**How it works:**\n1. You type a message in Discord \u2192 the bot sends it here\n2. Gemini Flash-8B classifies the task into one of 8 agents\n3. GrowthAgent acknowledges in Discord instantly\n4. The correct agent runs automatically\n5. Results appear in your Discord channel with HITL buttons\n\n**SETUP:** After import, click each 'Run Agent' node and select the corresponding sub-workflow from the dropdown.\n\n**Agents:** B2B Outreach, LinkedIn, Blog, Newsletter, Trend Research, COO Monitor, SEO/GEO/AEO, Content Strategist"
      },
